        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You create a small explosion of bright light and ear-piercing sound that rocks the senses. Creatures in the area take sonic damage with a basic Fortitude save. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines the damage and other parameters.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> This spell deals 1d10 sonic damage, and its area is a 5-foot square. Creatures that fail their save become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> This spell deals 2d10 sonic damage, and its area is a 10-foot burst. Creatures that fail their save become dazzled until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> This spell deals 2d10 sonic damage, and its area is a 20-foot burst. Creatures that fail their save become dazzled and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Deafened] until the end of your next turn.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10 for all versions.</p>"
